{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_008_03_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8d16fd07c45f3250a779fa1c07845eb79a27c06491e4fb222e41e1312c0fcfb5",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8902b61c95b06607883b6cef1cac707314853320fd7b665a6a37828d22fd676c",
      "text": "拼尽全力的理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9332949a39dc2db890fb1586d3c409af210e7e9f66d7c8026c83af3d11c70a2b",
      "text": "轻音部全员商讨起要在高中生乐队大赛演奏的曲目。\n其间，隼人提议使用原创曲目。\n为了迎接大赛，大家各自面对着自己的课题，\n心怀复杂思绪的旬想起了自己的过去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000027:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3a0c7f8f83c9759bf38e90e810580beff52236c88683724b5c13d354d17d97d",
      "text": "第3话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000027:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8902b61c95b06607883b6cef1cac707314853320fd7b665a6a37828d22fd676c",
      "text": "拼尽全力的理由",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59253806272b65d7bd8731420f38fe497196791758372bff3fef3fc20c491e0f",
      "text": "……呼。\n怎么样，我的架子鼓！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c1ef7304486c902da6cd9e8ffb44f38461bd5ec444743f13a320eab96e101c7a",
      "text": "很……厉害……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8d22836443161959553bbdced5c28da3c18eb12bf9772fb511b1606698957a1",
      "text": "太棒了！\n什么时候变得这么厉害了啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:81899f00c5fb2a3ffa546801083004970906c71181f0d04621f93f0e1c256431",
      "text": "嘿嘿，我和隼人一起去了乐器行，\n买了鼓棒之后就拼命练习了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:750ec7a1167a5513fb143a5b5c08b642c45947d8ca5cb61404cd6db83a71a7dc",
      "text": "因为家里没有架子鼓，\n我就拿杂志当打击垫练个不停呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:978b5c436d88ff7a0f323e672df127f116323e14ee9d1ada68f47e5030a1dff6",
      "text": "话虽如此，能进步到这种程度\n真的很厉害哦，春名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000108:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:18fd770aa64c3c2eb6528ac890c35f38fdfa4fff7a7b89b30c47757987d8defc",
      "text": "哎——！居然只有你们2个人去乐器行！？\n太狡猾了～！也要叫上我啊～～！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393737583fff05199a43be0b5aef081d64f4b605e6af0ff9c0099a7afc3f4041",
      "text": "……四季。下次……大家一起去吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0330b88e9906ebfc28d11ae158c7d65ce39e30c964dd906f7788a806a2eaf12e",
      "text": "绝对、绝对、绝——对哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_008hig_03_1_1_008_03:1_1_008_03_a:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c7e0f4a3aacfe97d1176efda4de3271a9284c6547879818f4614a7daab1761a",
      "text": "说完了吗？今天不是要决定乐队大赛上演奏的\n曲目吗？快点开始吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
